  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Dreadknight ranks affect mail and plate armor only (#1648)",
  "contract": "Dreadknight ranks 300560/301352 have aura 142 with physical mask 1, armor subclass mask 24 (mail and plate), and 20%/40% amounts; aura 186 applies -2%/-4% attacker spell hit chance. A zero-armor cloth chest (49241) first replaces each level-60 Reaper starter chest. The rank gain on that common baseline is compared with the gain after a cloth, leather, mail or plate chest replaces it. Cloth and leather must add no armor; mail and plate must add their rank percentage of item armor.",
